Android's rules for what the snail meets on the track. Its cRSubGoldy::Collision
(00077f5c) scores a health pickup as ScoreAdd kind 6, worth 250 (00070ed0);
Windows scores none, and the port files the 250 under the bonus kind, as the
Windows player keeps six score buckets. Collision and cRSubGame::AI (00082214)
cap the ring counter at 8 where Windows caps it at 10: below the cap a normal
ring plays the power-up voice and a default ramp ring keeps the next one close.
cRSubGame::AddRing (00073290) turns a default ramp ring slow on a single roll
above 0.93; Windows rolls RT2 for every ring the first roll leaves alone, and in
Time Trial turns half of those slow. cRSubLoc::AI (00077760) fires a wall turret when
RAND(100) falls below 4 + (1 - salt_frequency) * -3.5, following the level's
Salt: setting; Windows below 4.

